(root/'V13_0_NOTES.md').write_text('''# V13.0 — Practical Engineering Labs\n\nV13 turns the hub from primarily learning/interview content into a practical engineering training path.\n\n## Added\n- 12 Build Labs covering React + Spring Boot, REST, validation, pagination, search, JWT, errors, uploads, transactions, idempotency, observability and deployment.\n- 10 Debug Labs covering browser/network failures, HTTP auth, CORS, database performance, duplicate commands, Spring errors, async races, deployment, authorization and load-related latency.\n- 8 Architecture Labs showing an incremental path from a layered Spring Boot application to production-scale concerns.\n- Search, L1/L2/L3 filtering, expand/collapse and interview-ready delivery remain consistent with the existing hub.\n\n## Learning philosophy\nLearn → Build → Break → Debug → Explain.\n\nNo progress/gamification system was added. TypeScript remains intentionally last in the learning progression.\n''',encoding='utf-8')

